        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en"># Included processes\nElectricity from wind farm, fed to grid. Includes the operation of the wind farm with the necessary change of gear oil.\n100MW wind farm, consisting of 22 onshore wind turbines Vestas V163-4.5MW (Martinez Aguado &amp; Garrett, 2025).\nModel is based on the capacity factor of 23.5%, representing the average capacity factor of onshore wind farms in Europe between 2016-2024 (source: ENTSO-E).\nAssumed lifetime is 25 years. Annual electricity production is 204 GWh, applying a capacity factor of 23.5%.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
